OL,3,GNEWSASeven-year fight wins protection
OL,4,Afor green space
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community recreation site on the
OL,7,Fborder of Leeds and Bradford has been
OL,8,Fprotected from future development after
OL,9,Fa seven-year campaign by residents.
OL,11,FPart of Sunnybank Lane Recreation
OL,12,FGround in Thornbury will be safeguarded
OL,13,Fafter Leeds City Council approved an
OL,14,Fapplication to register the land as a
OL,15,Ftown or village green (TVG).
OL,17,FThe application submitted in 2019 had
OL,18,Ffaced opposition from Bradford Council,
OL,19,Fwhich owns the land.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
