OL,3,GNEWSASeven-year fight wins protection
OL,4,Afor green space
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut a public inquiry in May this year
OL,7,Ffound part of the site met the legal
OL,8,Ftests required for village green status
OL,9,Fand the final decision was made by the
OL,10,FLeeds authority.
